/// A tag group whose text ends right after the `=`. The same shape as the resource group above:
/// the declaration asks for the `[` and reports it when the text ends there, instead of reading
///  the terminal token as the bracket and putting one token in the tree twice.
module syntax_tag_group_open

tag finite =